{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_011Cg2hNGuoFTXgwZbUujEZa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All tests pass. Here's a summary of every fix:\n\n- **`graph/graph.go`**: Replaced the trivial map-iteration with Kahn's topological sort. The queue is sorted at each step to guarantee deterministic output. Returns an error if the processed count doesn't equal the graph size (cycle detection).\n\n- **`parse/parse.go`**: Added three validation passes: reject empty names, reject duplicate names, and reject deps that reference nodes not present in the graph.\n\n- **`cache/cache.go`**: Changed from a single `last` string to a `map[string]string` keyed on the raw input bytes. Errors are never stored, so a later call with valid input correctly recomputes.\n\n- **`batch/batch.go`**: Changed `continue` on error to `return nil, e` — any single failure makes the whole batch return nil atomically.\n\n- **`cmd/planner/main.go`**: Added stdin error handling, changed `fmt.Print` to `fmt.Println` (newline-terminated output), and added `os.Exit(1)` on any error path."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":153,"cache_read_input_tokens":25549,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":153},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0c199730-8dc0-4cac-9af8-4ebb3394313c","uuid":"94f6b392-f75d-4a7f-9e75-53ee81b6a339"}
